    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d261">

                <pb facs="0368" n="356" sameAs="frus:frus1946v07/pg356"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.24591/3–1546: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in the Soviet Union</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Kennan</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">priority</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Moscow</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1946-03-15">March 15,
                        1946</date>.<lb/>[Received March 15—10:29 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>815. Soviet press March 15 publishes Tass denial reading as follows in
                    translation: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>There has been published in American press a statement of State
                            Department of USA that there is taking place in Iran a shifting of
                            Soviet Military units through Tehran and [toward?] western frontier of
                            Iran. Tass is authorized to state that this report absolutely does not
                            correspond to reality.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <p>Sent Department 815, repeated Tehran 62, Tabriz and Frankfurt.</p>
                <closer>[<signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kennan</hi>
                    </signed>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
